# A Shelly Gen2+ JSON-RPC request frame. Public.
format        shelly-rpc-request
version       0.1.0
distribution  public
source        "Shelly Gen2+ device API documentation (Allterco Robotics), https://shelly-api-docs.shelly.cloud/gen2/ pages General/RPCProtocol, General/Notifications and ComponentsAndServices Switch, Cover, Input, Temperature and Sys, read 2026-11-21; Copyright (c) 2026 Allterco Robotics, no licence stated; member names restated"
uses          shelly
wire          json
field  shelly.jsonrpc  jsonrpc  string
field  shelly.src  src  string
field  shelly.method  method  string
field  shelly.param_id  params.id  int
field  shelly.param_on  params.on  bool
